ome 位置。"},"RAW_Sensor":{"Accel X":"加速度計 X","Accel Y":"加速度計 Y","Accel Z":"加速度計 Z","Flight Data":"飛行資料","Gyro X":"陀螺儀 X","Gyro Y":"陀螺儀 Y","Gyro Z":"陀螺儀 Z","Note: There is a delay \nwhen viewing via Xbee\n@ 50hz":"注意：如果是使用 Xbee 時 delay 頻率 @ 50hz","Radio":"遙控器","Radio IN":"遙控器輸入","Raw Sensor":"感應器原始數據","Save CSV":"儲存為 CSV","Servo/Motor OUT":"舵機/馬達輸入","Update Speed":"更新頻率"},"ScriptConsole":{"Autoscroll":"自動捲動","Clear":"清除","Print statements in the python code will print to this dialog box":"python 的程式碼會顯示在此視窗"},"Sikradio":{"Air Speed":"速率(空中)","Baud":"鮑率","Copy required to remote":"複製設定至機上端","Format":"格式版本","Load Settings":"載入設定","RSSI":"信號強度","Reset to Defaults":"還原出廠值","Save Settings":"儲存設定","Settings for Low Latency":"重設為最小延遲","Settings for Standard Mavlink":"重設為標準 Mavlink 協議","Status Leds":"Led 狀態說明","Upload Firmware (custom)":"更新客制化韌體","Upload Firmware (standard)":"更新韌體 (地面端)","Version":"韌體版本"},"Terminal":{"ATI - show radio version \nATI2 - show board type \nATI3 - show board frequency \nATI4 - show board version \nATI5 - show all user settable EEPROM parameters \nATI6 - display TDM timing report \nATI7 - display RSSI signal report \nATO - exit AT command mode \nATSn? - display radio parameter number 'n' \nATSn=X - set radio parameter number 'n' to 'X' \nATZ - reboot the radio \nATW - write current parameters to EEPROM \nATF - reset all parameters to factory default \nATT=RSSI - enable RSSI debug reporting \nATT=TDM - enable TDM debug reporting \nATT - disable debug reporting":"ATI - 顯示數傳版本 \nATI2 - 顯示板子的類型\nATI3 - 顯示板子的頻率\nATI4 - 顯示板子的版本 \nATI5 - 顯示所有使用者可設置的 EEPROM 參數 \nATI6 - 播放 TDM timing report \nATI7 - 播放 RSSI signal report \nATO - 離開 AT 命令模式 \nATSn? - display radio parameter number 'n' \nATSn=X - 將數傳參數由 'n' 改為 'X' \nATZ - 重啟數傳 \nATW - 將參數寫入至 EEPROM \nATF - 重設所有參數至出廠預設\nATT=RSSI - 啟用 RSSI 偵錯報告\nATT=TDM - 啟用 TDM 偵錯報告 \nATT - 停用 TDM 偵錯報告"},"TrackerUI":{"Angle":"角度","Connect":"連接","Interface":"介面","Misusing this interface can cause servo damage, use with caution!!